<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-10-intro">
  <title>Week 10</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>
      At the end of this week you should be able to...
    </p>
    <objectives>
      <ul>
        <li>describe properties of arrays</li>
        <li>use a REPL to evaluate simple array expressions</li>
        <li>trace the flow of control during the execution of a program using for-each loops</li>
        <li>identify type errors resulting from use of arrays</li>
        <li>develop programs that include arrays</li>
        <li>use a debugger to visualize the contents of an array during program execution</li>
      </ul>
    </objectives>
  </introduction>
  <xi:include href="sec-arrays.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="sec-iterating-over-collections.ptx"/>
</chapter>
